The primary claims DECIDED-F_DIM: the Record axiom's content-alone clause
excludes the embedding-space reading (the geometric L-face, F_res) by a
computed violation, leaving the readout obligation's positive half on the
content-space family (F_dim).

This checker tries to break that.  It is independent in four ways that
matter, and each is a place the primary could be wrong:

  (1) INDEPENDENT FORMALIZATION.  The primary splits "determined by record
      content alone" into three predicates (P_EMB, P_SCOPE, P_TOTAL).  This
