  (3) INDEPENDENT L-FACE ROUTE.  The primary builds an explicit normal-plane
      basis and takes a 2x2 determinant.  This checker uses the trace
      identity: for a rotation h with a 1-dimensional fixed axis,
      det_R(I - h|_N) = 3 - tr(h).  No basis is ever constructed.  A rank
